@scene intro
@backdrop textures/town.png [fadeIn=500]
@char HERO sprite=characters/player
@char NPC sprite=characters/villager

NPC: Welcome, traveler! What brings you here?

@choice
- I'm looking for adventure!
  HERO: I seek glory and treasure!
  NPC: Then you've come to the right place.
- Just passing through.
  HERO: Just a weary traveler.
  NPC: Rest well, friend.
@endchoice

@do fadeOut
@end
